<title>USA: CBOE to list options on TeleTech.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list options on TeleTech.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Friday it would list options on TeleTech Holdings Inc on November 8.</p>
<p>The exchange said opening strike prices were set at 25, 30 and 35, with initial expirations in December, January, April and July.</p>
<p>Shares of the customer care solution provider were off 1/2 at 31-1/2 in late morning trading Friday.</p>
<p>The CBOE said TeleTech options will trade in the EMC Corp trading crowd. --Derivatives desk, 312/408-8750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
